{"id":"637086","name":"香葱千层饼","author":"笑笑昵","authorId":"10878013","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/637086/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"猪肉馅","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香葱","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"老抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"淀粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡椒粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉中放入一点盐。","img":"images/637086/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"慢慢加水揉成面团盖上盖子醒十分钟。","img":"images/637086/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"肉馅中放入盐、生抽、老抽、胡椒粉、蚝油、淀粉搅拌上劲。","img":"images/637086/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入切碎的葱花。","img":"images/637086/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"淋上一小勺热油。","img":"images/637086/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/637086/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面团醒好后搓成长条切成面剂子。","img":"images/637086/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"取一个面剂子擀成长条状。","img":"images/637086/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"铺上肉馅。","img":"images/637086/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"叠起来。","img":"images/637086/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"把两边和中间相连处捏紧。","img":"images/637086/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"电饼铛中放油，放入做好的千层饼。","img":"images/637086/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"盖盖煎至两面金黄即可。","img":"images/637086/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637086/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/637086/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饼铛\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}